{"content":[{"c":["ELIZABETH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Woman of priestly descent (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.1.5","r":"Luke.1.5","rawR":"Luke.1.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.1.5","value":"Luke.1.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 1:5"},") and mother of John the Baptist, she was a relative of Mary, mother of Jesus (v ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.1.36","r":"Luke.1.36","rawR":"Luke.1.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.1.36","value":"Luke.1.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"36"},"). The name Elizabeth, which derives from the same Hebrew word as Elisheba, wife of Aaron (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.6.23","r":"Exod.6.23","rawR":"Exod.6.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.6.23","value":"Exod.6.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 6:23"},"), means “my God is an oath.” Only Luke’s Gospel, which characteristically focuses greater attention upon the role of women, mentions Elizabeth and her husband, Zechariah."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Luke emphasized Elizabeth and Zechariah’s godly character and blameless conduct (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.1.6","r":"Luke.1.6","rawR":"Luke.1.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.1.6","value":"Luke.1.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 1:6"},") before stating that the elderly couple had not been favored with children. Although in Jewish culture childlessness was regarded as a reproach (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.30.22-23","r":"Gen.30.22-23","rawR":"Gen.30.22-23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.30.22-23","value":"Gen.30.22-23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 30:22-23"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.1.25","r":"Luke.1.25","rawR":"Luke.1.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.1.25","value":"Luke.1.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 1:25"},"), the devout pair continued to steadfastly worship and serve God. Unexpectedly, an angel of the Lord appeared to Zechariah with the announcement that Elizabeth would conceive and bear a son, who would be the forerunner of the promised Messiah (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.1.13-17","r":"Luke.1.13-17","rawR":"Luke.1.13-17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.1.13-17","value":"Luke.1.13-17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 1:13-17"},"). When Elizabeth conceived, she withdrew from public life for five months, during which time her kinswoman Mary visited her."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=JohntheBaptist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"JohntheBaptist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"JohntheBaptist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"John the Baptist"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Elizabeth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Lk 1:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.1.5","rawQueryValue":"Luke.1.5","sourceRefExact":"Luke.1.5"},{"anchorText":"36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.1.36","rawQueryValue":"Luke.1.36","sourceRefExact":"Luke.1.36"},{"anchorText":"Ex 6:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.6.23","rawQueryValue":"Exod.6.23","sourceRefExact":"Exod.6.23"},{"anchorText":"Lk 1:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.1.6","rawQueryValue":"Luke.1.6","sourceRefExact":"Luke.1.6"},{"anchorText":"Gn 30:22-23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.30.22-23","rawQueryValue":"Gen.30.22-23","sourceRefExact":"Gen.30.22-23"},{"anchorText":"Lk 1:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.1.25","rawQueryValue":"Luke.1.25","sourceRefExact":"Luke.1.25"},{"anchorText":"Lk 1:13-17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.1.13-17","rawQueryValue":"Luke.1.13-17","sourceRefExact":"Luke.1.13-17"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"13c40f2dad5c2b3964dbd7949458ae3f00de252f1f7fa6cfb8b5a93ec0a24ac0","sourceItemName":"Elizabeth","sourceItemOrder":120,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Elizabeth","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Elizabeth","title":"Elizabeth","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}